# ======================================================
# MARI MILKAT REAL EMAIL DELIVERY CONFIGURATION (.env)
# ======================================================

# Option 1: Gmail (Recommended for personal testing)
# Step 1: Turn on 2-Factor Authentication on your Google Account
# Step 2: Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# Step 3: Create a 16-character App Password (e.g. "abcd efgh ijkl mnop")
# Step 4: Uncomment and fill in the two lines below:

# GMAIL_USER=yourgmail@gmail.com
# GMAIL_PASS=your16digitapppassword

# Option 2: Custom SMTP (SendGrid, Mailtrap, Resend, Amazon SES, etc.)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=yourgmail@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=yourpassword
# SMTP_FROM="Mari Milkat" <noreply@marimilkat.com>
